@startuml
title H01 - Hub ingest
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "H01\nHub ingest" as H01
interface "PeerRegistry::authorize/accepts; IngestQueue::callback_copy/pop" as API
database "Owned state\nauthorized source→session map, bounded ingress deque and rejection count" as State
queue "Input / output\nRadio callback DomainEvent → admitted fixed-value mailbox entry" as IO
API --> H01
IO --> H01
H01 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
H01 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
H01 ..> H02 : contract / port
component "H04\nHub coverage" as H04
H01 ..> H04 : contract / port
component "N02\nNode radio" as N02
H01 ..> N02 : contract / port
note bottom of H01
Flow: Authenticate source/session and sequence; copy into bounded queue; return immediately; state task later pops and processes.
Guard: Unknown session or full queue rejects and increments observable count. Callback never writes flash or runs rules.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
